{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787174409357251002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"erratic-illhumored-norwayrat","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"cede1116dc283747e87ae21feca1f5080885306cdca5e5a8de107f38f8d6a7d2","event_uuid":"a384d711-b630-46fd-a99e-42ab9e4d72e1","position":{"commit_sha":"10fc8105c793743b45ccb172146cb17dfb2d736e","position":"1787174395979208001-a384d711-b630-46fd-a99e-42ab9e4d72e1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"e74cdcd7a624801855600623fea83ad0ca317509a652063280a60f1161f4a899","event_uuid":"9e50afe0-4dfe-4d35-8fee-ef53a812418d","position":{"commit_sha":"45d323b3fb39a1cd4d275b9f49f6853a13e7b212","position":"1787174409357251001-9e50afe0-4dfe-4d35-8fee-ef53a812418d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787174395979208001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9e50afe0-4dfe-4d35-8fee-ef53a812418d","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"6f2e-58a5-dfac-42f3"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nAdding the `[code_review]` section re-export in ticket `unaroused-undead-ibisbill` took\n`src/rebar/config.py` from 799 to exactly 800 lines. The CI module-size gate fails on\n`loc > cap` with cap 800 (`.github/module-size-limit.txt`), so the file passes today but the\nNEXT line added to it — a new section class re-export, a new owned accessor — fails CI, and the\nlimit is locked so it cannot be raised by a contributor.\n\n## Approach\n\nSplit `src/rebar/config.py` along an existing call-graph seam, the same way `_config_schema.py`\nand `_config_sources.py` were already carved out of it, so the facade regains headroom without\nchanging any public import path (`from rebar.config import X` must keep working — the module\nalready re-exports every moved name).\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/config.py` — extract one cohesive cluster into a sibling private module.\n- the new sibling module.\n- tests covering the moved surface, if any assert on the old location.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `src/rebar/config.py` is at most 700 lines (`wc -l`), leaving headroom under the 800 cap.\n- [ ] Every name importable from `rebar.config` before the split is still importable after —\n      verified by the existing config test suite passing unchanged.\n- [ ] `make lint` and `make typecheck` exit 0.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"a66c-9329-e9c9-4aec","ticket_type":"task","title":"src/rebar/config.py sits at the 800-line module-size cap with zero headroom","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a384d711-b630-46fd-a99e-42ab9e4d72e1","9e50afe0-4dfe-4d35-8fee-ef53a812418d"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787174409357251002,"uuid":"769ab284-88bf-4c29-940e-2db95723be3b"}